{"4168400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fear of the Fallen", "steam_appid": 4168400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of <i>Fear Of The Fallen</i>, uncover its foundations, push its limits, and decide for yourself whom you can truly trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a dark, mysterious, yet at times cozy and peaceful world — full of variety and diverse landscapes.<br>And dungeons???<br><strong>Inspirations:</strong> <i>Metroid, classic Zelda titles, Hollow Knight</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: simple, effective, intuitive — yet hard to master, different builds.<br><strong>Inspirations:</strong> <i>Hollow Knight, Zelda, Sekiro / Nine Sols</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you’ll encounter all kinds of creatures. But beware — many of them won’t tolerate your presence as others might.<br>It’s up to you whether you distinguish between friend and foe, or place your own safety above mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear Of The Fallen</i> combines familiar elements of the genre with entirely new ideas.<br>Throughout your adventure, you’ll gain access to a steadily growing set of movement, combat, and utility abilities — helping you overcome obstacles more easily, defeat enemies faster, and gather resources more efficiently.<br><strong>Inspiration:</strong> <i>Metroidvanias</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful foes (and friends???)<br>Every boss fight is a unique experience — no mere “bigger enemy,” no “easy win.”<br><strong>Inspiration:</strong> <i>Souls series</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unique characters — friendly, helpful, clever, mysterious, malicious… senseless???<br>The success of your journey will depend greatly on how well you can make use of each individual’s special skills — from traders and craftsmen to other specialists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Fear Of The Fallen</i> is filled with mysteries and puzzles.<br>To solve them, you’ll need both your intellect and your sense for connections.<br>But don’t worry — you won’t find any forced or overly far-fetched riddles here.<br><strong>Inspirations:</strong> <i>We Were Here, Luigi’s Mansion</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gathering &amp; Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region not only has its own look and atmosphere, but also a unique pool of resources — certain plants or ores can only be found in specific areas.<br>Collected items can be refined, traded with merchants, or used directly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your exploration, you’ll occasionally discover new “recipes” or blueprints that allow you — with the right help and materials — to craft new items.<br>With a good network of traders and craftsmen, you might even develop larger, more ambitious projects.<br><strong>Inspiration:</strong> <i>Survival–Crafting genre</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s up to you to uncover it.<br>Told partly in classic dark-fantasy fashion — abstractly, through dialogue and descriptions — and partly through manga-style cutscenes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of <i>Fear Of The Fallen</i>, uncover its foundations, push its limits, and decide for yourself whom you can truly trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a dark, mysterious, yet at times cozy and peaceful world — full of variety and diverse landscapes.<br>And dungeons???<br><strong>Inspirations:</strong> <i>Metroid, classic Zelda titles, Hollow Knight</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: simple, effective, intuitive — yet hard to master, different builds.<br><strong>Inspirations:</strong> <i>Hollow Knight, Zelda, Sekiro / Nine Sols</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you’ll encounter all kinds of creatures. But beware — many of them won’t tolerate your presence as others might.<br>It’s up to you whether you distinguish between friend and foe, or place your own safety above mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear Of The Fallen</i> combines familiar elements of the genre with entirely new ideas.<br>Throughout your adventure, you’ll gain access to a steadily growing set of movement, combat, and utility abilities — helping you overcome obstacles more easily, defeat enemies faster, and gather resources more efficiently.<br><strong>Inspiration:</strong> <i>Metroidvanias</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful foes (and friends???)<br>Every boss fight is a unique experience — no mere “bigger enemy,” no “easy win.”<br><strong>Inspiration:</strong> <i>Souls series</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unique characters — friendly, helpful, clever, mysterious, malicious… senseless???<br>The success of your journey will depend greatly on how well you can make use of each individual’s special skills — from traders and craftsmen to other specialists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Fear Of The Fallen</i> is filled with mysteries and puzzles.<br>To solve them, you’ll need both your intellect and your sense for connections.<br>But don’t worry — you won’t find any forced or overly far-fetched riddles here.<br><strong>Inspirations:</strong> <i>We Were Here, Luigi’s Mansion</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gathering &amp; Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region not only has its own look and atmosphere, but also a unique pool of resources — certain plants or ores can only be found in specific areas.<br>Collected items can be refined, traded with merchants, or used directly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your exploration, you’ll occasionally discover new “recipes” or blueprints that allow you — with the right help and materials — to craft new items.<br>With a good network of traders and craftsmen, you might even develop larger, more ambitious projects.<br><strong>Inspiration:</strong> <i>Survival–Crafting genre</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s up to you to uncover it.<br>Told partly in classic dark-fantasy fashion — abstractly, through dialogue and descriptions — and partly through manga-style cutscenes.</p>", "short_description": "FearOfTheFallen blends classic Metroidvania gameplay with the mechanics of an action RPG. Explore diverse biomes, fight your way through a multitude of creatures, solve puzzles, collect items, craft equipment, uncover secrets, and face your fiercest foes in epic boss battles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168400/6816264ece5583098dacc628eb46aa2514add252/header.jpg?t=1781360309", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168400/3951afc5b69697a98eccc16a82b9d24e503441c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781360309", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/416840